const prices={'Coffee beans':5,'Milk':3,'Chocolate syrup':4,'Vanilla ice cream':5,'Cat food':4,'Fresh bread':3,'Cat treats':5,'Toy mouse':4,'Laundry detergent':4,'Tomato seeds':3,'Carrot seeds':3,'Basil seeds':3,'Flower seeds':3};
function buy(n){let price=prices[n]||4;if(S.money<price)return notify(`That’s ${price} coins; save a little and come back.`);S.money-=price;add(n);if(mode==='market')notify(`${n} tucked into your satchel. −${price} coins.`);save()}
function sell(){let goods=['Latte','Cortado','Cappuccino','Americano','Mocha','Affogato','Toast','Garden salad','Tomatoes','Carrots','Fresh basil','Garden bouquet'];panel('VILLAGE MARKET · CO-OP','A fair little exchange','<p>Neighbors trade what they grow and make. Your earnings help the village go round.</p><div class="cards">'+goods.map(n=>`<div class="card"><div class="cardtext"><strong>${n}</strong><small>${has(n)?'Ready to share':'Not in your satchel'}</small></div><button class="buy" data-sell="${n}" ${has(n)?'':'disabled'}>Sell · ${n==='Garden salad'||n==='Mocha'?6:n==='Latte'||n==='Cappuccino'?5:3}¢</button></div>`).join('')+'</div><div class="action-row"></div>');$('#panel').querySelectorAll('[data-sell]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{let n=b.dataset.sell;if(!take(n))return notify(`You don’t have ${n.toLowerCase()} to sell.`);let v=n==='Garden salad'||n==='Mocha'?6:n==='Latte'||n==='Cappuccino'?5:3;S.money+=v;save();notify(`${n} shared with a neighbor. +${v} coins.`);sell()});action('Close',closePanel)}
function travel(where){closePanel();mode=where;home.visible=where==='home';yard.visible=where==='garden';market.visible=where==='market';if(where==='home'){camera.position.set(0,1.65,4.7);yaw=Math.PI;pitch=0}else if(where==='garden'){camera.position.set(0,1.65,-5.15);yaw=Math.PI;pitch=0}else{camera.position.set(0,1.65,7.2);yaw=0;pitch=0}hud();notify(where==='home'?'Back in your cozy cottage.':where==='garden'?'The garden is quiet and green.':'The little village market is open.')}
function dvdMenu(){let all=[['The Lantern in the Pines','An original, wordless story of a tiny lantern keeping fireflies company.'],['A Very Small Sea','An original seaside vignette: tides, gulls, and a red paper boat.'],['The Moth & Moon','An original midnight tale about a moth finding its way home.'],['Postcards from Winter','An original snow-day film, told in warm little painted scenes.']];panel('LIVING ROOM · MAGNAVOX','A little movie night','<p>Put on one of your original, locally made little films. The old Magnavox warms up slowly.</p><div class="cards">'+all.map(([n,d])=>`<div class="card"><div class="cardtext"><strong>▣ ${n}</strong><small>${d}</small></div><button class="buy" data-film="${n}" ${S.dvds.includes(n)?'':'disabled'}>${S.dvds.includes(n)?'Play':'Not owned'}</button></div>`).join('')+'</div><div class="action-row"></div>');$('#panel').querySelectorAll('[data-film]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>playFilm(b.dataset.film));action('Close',closePanel)}
function tvMenu(){if(film){panel('MAGNAVOX · NOW PLAYING',film,'<p>The colors flicker softly on the little curved screen. A quiet film, made just for this world.</p><div class="action-row"></div>');action('Stop the film',()=>{film='';closePanel();notify('The Magnavox clicks softly back to standby.')},true);action('Browse DVDs',dvdMenu)}else dvdMenu()}
